@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #555
title DRAM 一頁圖（Genio 720 EVK，LPDDR5 8 GiB，2 channel × 2 rank）

rectangle "燒錄時 LK（prebuilt）\nlibdram-lk ca5e1f7，_FLASH_MODE_DA_\n只校 3200 Mbps 一組，完整校正\n不存結果、不做 SMPU" as lk
rectangle "BL2（每次開機）\nlibdram-prebuilt 315bfaa\n先開 UFS 讀 GPT → dramk 分區\n5 組 shuffle（6400/5500/4266/3200/2133）\n用存好的校正值，219 ms\n最後停在 SHU0 = 6400" as bl2
rectangle "dramk 分區（sdc5，512 KiB）\nheader：版本 0xbfaa6eef、magic 0x9502\nbuild time 20251210-021218\n每個 shuffle 一份＋CRC16" as dramk
rectangle "BL31\n載 DPM ×2、SPM、SSPM\nSMPU：保護 BL31、OP-TEE（10 MiB）" as bl31
rectangle "OP-TEE／U-Boot\n只用、不改\n大小：寫死／BOOT_ARGUMENT" as mid
rectangle "Linux\n沒有 DRAM 調頻 driver\n閒置、壓力、suspend 前後都是 6400" as linux

lk -[hidden]-> bl2
bl2 <--> dramk
bl2 --> bl31
bl31 --> mid
mid --> linux
@enduml
